    "created_at": "2023-10-29T15:55:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-10-29T15:55:35Z",
    "body": "> I'm not entirely convinced we need this feature as this is commonly available in browsers through a keyboard shortcut or touching the top of the screen.\r\n\r\nI totally agree that it is available with keyboard shortcut but I think most of the audience doesn't know these shortcuts so providing them a button UI with which they can interact will be more convenient and will enhance the overall user experience.\r\nPlease feel free and let me know what do you think **@annevk**  ",
